 ### RealmDreamer
-RealmDreamer utilizes diffusion priors from inpainting and depth estimation models to generate different viewpoints of a scene iteratively [S2, unofficial]. Unlike Focaldreamer which focuses on editing a single scene with a mask, RealmDreamer uses these priors to synthesize consistent multi-view data for scene composition or generation. It is chosen when iterative viewpoint generation is required for scene-level consistency rather than localized editing.
